  "content": "<p>为支持团队进度的模组（如FTB区块和FTB任务）提供库支持。在任务系统中，允许多人共同完成同一任务；在FTB区块中，允许方块之间的团队交互，无需单独列入白名单。</p>\n<p>在我们的文档网站上了解更多关于FTB队伍的信息：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-teams</a></p>\n<p>要创建队伍，请使用\"/ftbteams create 队伍名称\"。要修改设置，请使用\"/ftbteams settings &lt;key&gt; &lt;value&gt;\"，按Tab键可循环浏览选项。队伍数据存储在world/data/ftbteams文件夹中。</p>\n<h2>支持</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如遇<strong>整合包</strong>问题，请前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>如遇<strong>模组</strong>问题，请前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>只是想咨询问题？欢迎加入我们的Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持关注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
